## 🔄 Quick Review

### TOEIC

1. The employee _____ works here is very friendly.
→ who

2. The computer _____ I bought is fast.
→ which / that

3. The student _____ laptop was stolen reported it.
→ whose

4. The office _____ I work is nearby.
→ where

