## 🎤 OPIc Challenge

Answer without looking at the sample answer:

Tell me about a time when something surprised you.

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

### Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

I expected...

↓

But...

↓

What surprised me was...

↓

How I felt

↓

In the end...

